  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7618301",
      "subQuestName": "Head to a high vantage point in the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761830101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761830101": {
            "id": "761830101",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Thanks for the invitation, Sandrone. This food tastes just like I remember. It really brings back memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830102"
            ]
          },
          "761830102": {
            "id": "761830102",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "You're welcome. If you like, we can get together more often when I'm back in Snezhnaya. It'll be just like the old days.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830103"
            ]
          },
          "761830103": {
            "id": "761830103",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830104"
            ]
          },
          "761830104": {
            "id": "761830104",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Speaking of Snezhnaya, how's everything going on your end?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830105"
            ]
          },
          "761830105": {
            "id": "761830105",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Her Majesty the Tsaritsa's plans have made some initial progress, but Project Stuzha is proving more difficult to implement than the Mayor anticipated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830106"
            ]
          },
          "761830106": {
            "id": "761830106",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Then it appears we'll both be busy from now on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830107"
            ]
          },
          "761830107": {
            "id": "761830107",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Though we should still have time to stop for a cup of tea every now and then, or even catch a performance by the Korolevskiy Troupe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830124"
            ]
          },
          "761830124": {
            "id": "761830124",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Indeed. Though we should still have time to stop for a cup of tea every now and then, or even catch a performance by the Korolevskiy Troupe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830108"
            ]
          },
          "761830108": {
            "id": "761830108",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Is Odette still performing ballet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830109"
            ]
          },
          "761830109": {
            "id": "761830109",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Yes. Every time I see her, she seems to keep getting better.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830110"
            ]
          },
          "761830110": {
            "id": "761830110",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Amazing. I'd love to see her perform again when I'm back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830111"
            ]
          },
          "761830111": {
            "id": "761830111",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I find it really quite fascinating. Despite learning her craft under Rosalyne, their temperaments and styles couldn't be more different.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830112"
            ]
          },
          "761830112": {
            "id": "761830112",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "That's not necessarily a bad thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830113"
            ]
          },
          "761830113": {
            "id": "761830113",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "True... Rosalyne danced with a fiery passion, whereas Odette is as frosty and opaque as a block of solid ice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830114"
            ]
          },
          "761830114": {
            "id": "761830114",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "She appears to be carrying a heavy burden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830115"
            ]
          },
          "761830115": {
            "id": "761830115",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "And yet, when she performs on stage, her movements are so pure, as though her heart were free from even the tiniest of blemishes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830116"
            ]
          },
          "761830116": {
            "id": "761830116",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Or perhaps she's sealed such things away where no one will see them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830117"
            ]
          },
          "761830117": {
            "id": "761830117",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Perhaps. In the end, isn't that what ice does — freeze over the cracks? But she's not fragile, she's resolute. If anything, I'd say she's dangerous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830118"
            ]
          },
          "761830118": {
            "id": "761830118",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "At least in that regard, she resembles Rosalyne.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830119"
            ]
          },
          "761830119": {
            "id": "761830119",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Because she's dangerous?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830120"
            ]
          },
          "761830120": {
            "id": "761830120",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Because of her resolve.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830121"
            ]
          },
          "761830121": {
            "id": "761830121",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I suppose you're right. No wonder there are rumors that she's the favorite to inherit the \"La Signora\" title.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830122"
            ]
          },
          "761830122": {
            "id": "761830122",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hah... Once we get to know her better, we could invite her to our tea parties. I hope she won't refuse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761830123"
            ]
          },
          "761830123": {
            "id": "761830123",
            "speakerId": 1080,
            "speakerName": "The Knave",
            "text": "Me too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7618302",
      "subQuestName": "Head to a high vantage point in the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau to start the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
